    "gp_section_636581633142883030": {
      "settings": {
        "checksum": "7643b32ef958fea41d3e9a2e40bd9d89611be5b7082d04180ed64c014de584f5_1_1_1_0__1",
        "gg0pLVMam0s_text": "Frequently Asked Questions",
        "gg4TkwRjFpV_text": "<p>Yes! Simply add a favorite family photo, vacation memory, milestone moment, or other special picture to personalize your Keepsake Frame Box.</p>",
        "ggDFVBy3_ux_text": "<p>ThePhotoStick Omni is sold separately unless otherwise specified as part of a bundle. The Keepsake Frame Box is designed as the perfect add-on to make your ThePhotoStick Omni more giftable and display-ready.</p>",
        "ggaEVrQTJHR_text": "<p>No problem! The Keepsake Frame Box includes multiple inserts that can be displayed in place of a personal photo. This makes it easy to create a polished, gift-ready presentation even when you don’t have time to print a picture.</p>",
        "ggmySa8-oE__text": "<p>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you’re not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to help you with a return. We want you to be happy!</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please contact us at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our <a href=\"https://www.thephotostick.com/pages/support-return-and-refund-process\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>Returns and Refunds</strong></a> page.</p>",
        "ggqsP5Ip4P5_background_mobile_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPS_LP_Mobile_33.png",
        "ggqsP5Ip4P5_background_tablet_image_src": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/1681/4029/files/TPS_LP_Mobile_33.png",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_0": "<p>Does ThePhotoStick® Omni come with the Keepsake Frame Box?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_1": "<p>Can I add my own photo to the frame?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_2": "<p>What if I don’t have a photo ready to put in the frame?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_3": "<p>What is the Keepsake Frame Box made from?</p>",
        "ggw7bbKA89T_childItem_4": "<p>How does the 30-Day Money Back Guarantee work?</p>",
        "ggy8wQHDqPh_text": "<p>The box features a sleek black leather outer case with an inner drawer constructed from kraft and EVA materials, creating an attractive combination of presentation and protective storage.</p>"
      },
